  s2: Run nlpAssessment service
  s3: Document or access error
  s4: Assessment service failed or timed out
  s5: Step 1: Annotate and assess with AI support
  s6: Load second-step document
  s7: Run textualFeedback service
  s8: Second-step document or access error
  s9: Feedback service failed or timed out
