  s11: Confirm finish
  s12: Submitting session
  s13: Session finished
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Start [admitted writable session]
  s1 --> s2: Document loaded#59; configured service starts
  s1 --> s3: Document load fails
  s2 --> s4: Service fails or times out
  s2 --> s5: Service settles successfully
  s3 --> s1: Reload after resolving problem
  s4 --> s2: Retry failed request
  s4 --> s5: Skip service support
  s5 --> s6: Next [assessment optional or all criteria saved]
  s6 --> s7: Document loaded#59; configured service starts
  s6 --> s8: Document load fails
  s7 --> s9: Service fails or times out
  s7 --> s10: Service settles successfully
  s8 --> s6: Reload after resolving problem
  s9 --> s7: Retry failed request
  s9 --> s10: Skip service support
  s10 --> s5: Previous [allowBackward=true]
  s10 --> s11: Finish
  s11 --> s12: Confirm finish [study not closed]
